WEBVTT

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.980
We managed to break through...

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:14.680
I wish he'd tell us what the next step in his plan is, already.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.560
You mean L-Elf?

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:18.140
Yes. He never tells us anything until the very last minute.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:18.990
Hi, ladies!

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.000
Wh-Why aren't you wearing any clothes?!

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.880
Who cares? It's damned hot!

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.500
You're not in your own bedroom!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.250
Be a bit more conside—

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.010
Shut it, already.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.880
Renboukouji!

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:41.140
Satomi's more likely to answer to that.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.910
Oh, right.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:46.770
Akira! I'd like to thank you for coming along!

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.020
How about showing yourself?

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.640
We can't keep communicating via text forever.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:52.780
Enough.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:55.910
Anything that concerns Akira goes through me first.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:59.280
But we're brothers in arms...

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:03.700
It is <i>my</i> duty to protect her.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.830
As her <i>real</i> brother.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:07.920
What about on the battlefield?

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.900
Do we have to depend on you to relay everything?

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.620
Ah, well...

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:15.600
Akira?

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.560
Oh, crap.

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:29.980
Piss off.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.980
Akira...

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:19.720
Our destination is the Ookuma district in the former terrestrial territory of JIOR.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:22.680
So we're out to retake JIOR!

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.160
This is just a recon mission. Don't go twisting things around.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:27.100
Same shit.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:31.180
We descend to Earth through the follow rings.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:34.810
If we attach ourselves to a rent-a-shuttle at the entrance platform,

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:38.360
all we'll need to do is go through the follow rings.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.740
So we just stay between those rings?

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:47.520
The descent process is fully automated, so even a group of newbies can handle it.

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:51.250
The only problem is that permission is needed to descend.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:52.620
That won't be an issue.

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:54.460
You heard the man.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.300
That stuff's too complicated for me. I'm leaving it to you.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.980
Show me once again!

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.010
What's wrong?

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:02.840
We need to hurry.

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.540
Since there's still time.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.260
That's true.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:11.160
Now, our only choice is to fight.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.900
I'll take any bit of power I can, even if it's cursed.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.520
Quit pulling my leg!

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:22.070
I'm not making this up! She's frickin' hot, dude!

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:26.000
Yeah, right. Closest you've ever been to a hot babe was through your screen.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.580
Nah, man. It's true.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:32.680
If they found out that the pilot of Unit 6, Renboukouji Akira, was the legendary Little Witch,

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.040
everyone'd be all over her.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.240
Yeah, maybe if she really is hot.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:37.250
I wonder if those stories are true.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.840
You know, about how she hacked the entrance exam for the national university's high school.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.260
They're behind state-of-the-art cybersecurity!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.980
If that was true, she'd be a god.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:47.600
Well, that's just one part of the story...

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:50.430
Ah. You mean the bullying.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.000
Is that true, too?

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:56.850
I never would have thought that hacker was your little sister.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:59.440
Why are you spoiling her so much?

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.440
She got bullied for her own actions, and then she cut all ties to the outside world.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.450
It's all her own fault.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.740
You have no idea what you're talking about!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.120
Sorry.

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:17.120
Satomi? Satomi!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:28.140
People tell me all the time that my cooking looks bad, but it tastes great!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.580
But wafers with pickles? You can't be serious.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:34.640
It's the best! You'll believe it once you give it a try!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.600
There are many kinds of pickles,

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.940
but I recommend the JIOR traditional "cartwright" pickles.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.900
They're just perfect!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:48.160
I thought that since it's so great with rice, then maybe it'd go with snacks, too!

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:54.000
Ouch!

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:07.340
Wh-Where am I?

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:14.280
Gotcha.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.520
Want some?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:18.440
It's pretty good with pickles.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.950
Shoko asked me to take care of you.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.450
She said that you're a good person, but you're not used to people.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:33.540
Sh-She did?

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:36.560
You're friends, right?

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.420
I guess that makes us friends, too.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.630
The friend of my friend is my friend.

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.210
Shoko would say that for sure.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.220
F-Friends...

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:50.470
Yeah. Friends.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:53.640
Satomi

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:53.720
Satomi

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:53.800
Satomi

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:53.890
Satomi

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:54.850
Satomi

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.300
Do you hate your brother?

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:04.580
He never stood up for me, y-yet all he talks about is family.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.980
So selfish. Hate it.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:09.400
I only have bad memories of him.

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:14.180
Better than not having any memories at all.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.620
You can't even be sad about it, since there's nothing to remember.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:28.600
You lose.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:43.740
Once I get to Earth... to JIOR,

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:45.730
will I be able to remember something?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:16.000
Very prince-like. You're so picturesque.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.400
Why don't you try it yourself, Q-Vier?

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.590
I think I'll pass.

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:23.890
Where's H-Neun?

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.270
Playing hooky. Whaddya expect?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:50.100
The guy's a total straight arrow with this hilarious bob cut.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:52.670
And the midget's just a pain in the ass.

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.720
You always sound like you're having fun.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.680
How's the guy who wears glasses doing?

00:08:58.030 --> 00:08:59.840
Well,

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.260
just fine, I'd guess.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:06.190
By the way, that movie we were talking about the other day—what was it called again?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:21.370
Think you can take me to the beach?

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:22.950
I'm not a taxi.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.080
Is the seaside too sentimental for you?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.340
Let's go to somewhere less public, then,

00:09:28.340 --> 00:09:29.840
and we can talk in private.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:31.460
What do you mean?

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:35.680
Isn't that the reason why you've been tailing me all day?

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:40.970
I'll take a rain check.

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:44.520
Want to grab some tea?

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:00.990
Your authorization has been cleared.

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.840
You are permitted to board.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:07.620
Once you are through immigration control, the follow rings will be unlocked.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:08.750
Have a pleasant flight.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.260
Hm, this one's unschedu—

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:26.230
You?!

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:27.480
L-El—

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.980
That's me.

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.490
What's up with that unscheduled ship?

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:47.000
The usual. People trying to cut in line using "special clearance from the authorities".

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.000
Sheesh, again? Roger that.

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:00.340
It all worked out.

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:05.760
There are three JIOR postal freighters and a passenger ship en route for the New Guinea ringpath.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:11.360
That one's a private jet, huh? Then a freighter could be the best idea to disguise our landing.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:14.400
You can make out all of that? Impressive!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.280
That's always been his forte.

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:20.280
What's this channel?

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:22.450
Don't!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.330
Communication frequency matched!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:29.580
It's the same as Module 77's!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.160
Can you confirm that?

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:32.460
All personnel to combat stations!

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.460
Don't let them land!

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:39.590
It's the Dorssians!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.090
How did they find us?!

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.600
It's not hard once you know our frequency.

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:47.850
Was... Was this my fault?

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.350
I thought you said there wasn't gonna be any fighting!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.600
Our top priority is keeping the ship on track!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.860
If we stray outside the rings, we won't be able to land!

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:57.070
Hold up until we're through, huh?

00:11:57.670 --> 00:12:01.570
Don't let them near the ship. We won't withstand even a single hit.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.570
All units, remain close to the ship!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.660
That's a helluva lot of warnings.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:12.960
There's one below us, too!

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:17.090
Which one do we focus on?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.170
Both, of course!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:21.480
The one below is an Ideal custom. Take it out.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.740
Satomi, I brought you porridge—

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.320
What are you doing?!

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:36.140
I'm fine.

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:37.980
But you're burning up!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.280
I'm fine. This is important.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.580
I have to get into the best school.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:42.990
I have to pass this test!

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:44.490
Satomi...

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:47.140
I have to do this... I have to...

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:50.520
Anything short of a national school is unacceptable.

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:52.000
Is that clear, Satomi?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:55.500
This is your chance to be a winner. Part of the elite.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.630
Everything hangs on this.

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.680
I have to pass. I have to.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:09.390
This entire situation...

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.330
It's no good! Heat's too high!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:37.540
So what now?!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.300
I'm at my limit!

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.890
I can't keep this up much longer!

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.600
Come to daddy! I'll beat your ass raw!

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:51.220
Enough.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.220
Why?!

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:53.770
There's no time.

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:57.690
If you stray too far from the ship, you'll hit the heat limit right away and won't be able to make it back.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.980
So how come <i>that</i> ship can move around just fine, then?!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:03.490
It's custom-fitted to a re-entry shuttle.

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:06.490
It can descend by itself as long as it doesn't get shot down.

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:09.520
Get back to the ship. You're almost at your limits.

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:11.600
Yamada, retreat!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:14.620
Even if I did, all it takes is one hit and we're history, remember?

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.600
Yamada! Get back here!

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.250
After I take this asshole out!

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:23.750
Oh, shit!

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:25.340
Fuck!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.630
Yamada!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:30.720
You okay?

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:35.820
The enemy ship!

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:36.980
Oh, no!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.990
It's my fault!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:42.730
We're going down!

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.490
Akira?!

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:52.490
Akira?

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:09.510
Akira!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:11.850
The enemy's closing in again!

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:16.310
What should we do?!

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:21.270
Teach! We got one up and running!

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:23.540
Great! Well done!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.320
Tokishima, do you copy?

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:26.940
Yes!

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:30.320
Wanna try out a new toy? It's called the Familiar.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.950
You made it in time?

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:41.540
Impact booster, commence docking sequence!

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:49.880
Heat down!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:50.920
More!

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:09.760
Whoa!

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:10.640
It only took one blow!

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:12.910
Call Tokishima back. We'll stay on this descent path.

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:14.280
Wait!

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:17.120
What about Akira?! We have to get Akira!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.200
Unit 6 is too far from the ship.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.360
It's beyond help.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:28.670
Just like it was back then... I...

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.820
Why did I go and do this?

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:41.710
I knew this would happen.

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:44.960
It doesn't matter what I do...

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.440
Satomi...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:51.800
Satomi!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:52.740
Akira.

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:58.930
You must be Akira. I've got a few questions I'd like to ask you.

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:06.890
You would've had to take the exam today, correct?

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:10.640
Did you ask her to hack into the system?

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:19.560
No.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:23.160
I have no idea why she would do such a thing.

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:45.850
Help me!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.060
He doesn't care about me at all.

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:10.040
Takahi.

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:15.170
Steer us towards Akira. Please.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:16.800
Satomi...

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:18.760
Haruto!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:19.300
What?

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.680
It's Unit 1!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.680
What are you doing?! Come back at once!

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:28.180
I can't abandon a friend!

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:30.380
I'm going to help her!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.810
Fool.

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:48.250
What did he do?

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:53.840
It couldn't take the load?

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:54.670
What about the controls?!

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.550
Haruto!

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.800
Haruto! Haruto!

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:06.350
Change course immediately! We must save Akira!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:09.300
If we override our trajectory now, we'll end up burning to a crisp!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.310
So what, you want to just abandon her?!

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:16.940
If I let this go, I'll never be able to make things right with her!

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:20.820
This time, I will protect her as her brother!

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:38.840
Transmission from Unit 6. What's this?

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:42.860
These are ground control radio transmissions.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.130
Is she hacking them?

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.640
Hacking?

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:49.720
The point is that if we leave this course, we could still make it through the atmosphere

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:52.020
if we latched onto another ship.

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:56.310
This is Akira's voice!

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:58.770
She's calling for help!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:01.240
We're supposed to find the right path?

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:04.360
But how? Are you serious?

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:05.780
This is just noise!

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:08.030
I can't catch a word of it!

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:10.870
Stop frickin' yapping all at once!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.790
I can't do it! I got no clue!

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:19.560
Steer... towards 10:40.

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:25.390
Adjust... entry angle... to 27 degrees... north-northeast.

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:27.680
Satomi? But how?

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.730
I'll give the orders.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:32.700
Handle the ship controls for me, please!

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:35.690
You want me to jeopardize everything just to save your sister?

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:39.480
If we do nothing, we'll end up losing two Valvraves.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:42.440
I suspect that would inconvenience you quite a bit.

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:43.490
Takahi...

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:46.950
You can't stand at the top without being assertive.

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.950
We need Haruto, don't we?

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:55.210
You're the only one with the skills to
successfully land even if we steer off course.

00:21:55.810 --> 00:21:59.740
Please, L-Elf. I'm begging you!

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:03.210
Very well.

00:22:08.630 --> 00:22:10.220
<i>I won't miss a word.</i>

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:15.730
<i>I kept pretending not to hear.</i>

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.230
<i>I kept pretending not to see.</i>

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:26.240
Help me! Help me! Help me!

00:22:32.690 --> 00:22:33.750
Satomi!

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:35.500
Akira!

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.250
Satomi!

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:41.380
<i>I'm done running away.</i>

00:22:41.990 --> 00:22:44.510
<i>I'll assume responsibility for the crime and accept my share of the punishment.</i>

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:46.130
<i>Because we're family!</i>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:54.640
Units 1 and 6 have made it aboard the shuttle.

00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:55.890
Satomi!

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:26.400
So pretty...

00:23:39.630 --> 00:23:42.860
Akira! Akira, are you okay?

00:23:43.910 --> 00:23:46.190
You talk too much.

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:48.490
Come on!

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:49.690
Haruto, are you okay?

00:23:50.310 --> 00:23:51.280
Haruto!

00:23:55.730 --> 00:23:57.370
The wound on his eye...

00:23:57.370 --> 00:23:58.360
L-Elf.

00:23:58.360 --> 00:23:59.410
What?

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:02.290
Where did we end up landing?

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:04.670
We strayed from our route.

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:07.360
This is...

00:24:08.530 --> 00:24:10.120
...Dorssian territory.

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:14.180
PREVIEW

00:24:13.310 --> 00:24:17.680
Next time, episode 15: Return to Karlstein.

00:24:18.910 --> 00:24:24.440
Valvrave the Liberator... The system that unveils the world.

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:26.940
EPISODE 15

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:26.940
Return to Karlstein
